OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FDr Thomas has some strong advice
OL,7,     Ffor a builder who is fearless of
OL,8,     Fthe sun's rays, and Dr Cordell
OL,9,     Fbelieves a woman's headaches might
OL,10,     Fbe caused by the pain killers she
OL,11,     Fis using.
OL,12,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FThe staff and patients of
OL,14,     FBarnsley's A&E department are put
OL,15,     Funder the microscope. 84-year-old
OL,16,     FTerry, comes in with a
OL,17,     Fbadly-broken ankle and fears he
OL,18,     Fmay never dance again.
